Since there are 7 days in a week, we can find the remainder when 284 is divided by 7 to determine the day of the week for the 284th day. 284 divided by 7 is 40 with a remainder of 4, so the 284th day is 4 days after Tuesday. Counting forward, we find that the 284th day is a $\boxed{\text{Saturday}}$.
The answer is: \text{Saturday}

